      "description": "Careers at Walsh SKIP TO PAGE CONTENT Menu Mobile Menu Mobile Site Search Academics Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Online & Accelerated Programs Academic Services Experiential Learning Academic and Community Engagement Centers Alumni and Career Connections Office of the Registrar Academic Calendar Class Schedules Admission & Aid First-Time Students WU Promise Grant Transfer Students International Students Military & Veteran Students Service to Scholars Discount Program First Generation Students Graduate Students Virtual Tour Financial Aid College Credit Plus Online & Accelerated Students Athletics Campus Life Office of Student Experience Campus Ministry Cavs Cor Cordium Activities & Organizations Visual & Performing Arts Housing & Dining Counseling & Health Services Campus Safety Online & Accelerated Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Certificates Licensures & Endorsements Skilled Workforce Training Request Info Library Give Visit Apply MyWalsh Search the Website Search Our Website Submit Careers at Walsh Share on Facebook Share on Twitter/X Share on LinkedIn Email this page: Careers at Walsh Print this page Home About Walsh Human Resources Careers at Walsh Walsh University is a Catholic, Liberal Arts institution of higher education. We invite you to learn more about the foundation of our beliefs and practices by reviewing the Apostolic Constitution on Catholic Higher Education (PDF) and the Newman Guide .  Every member of the Walsh community has a role in supporting our students and we seek employees who feel called to support our Values and Mission . If that is you, we welcome you to apply for our employment opportunities. We encourage you to complete your application from a desk or laptop to ensure all information requested is provided. Chrome is typically the best browser to use when applying. You must submit a complete application and sign the acknowledgment to be considered for employment. If you have questions, we ask that you email us at employment@walsh.edu . Jami Swain\n\t\t\t\t- Vice President for Human Resources Phone: 330.490.7226 Email: jswain@walsh.edu Office: Farrell Hall 104B Jennifer Hoffner\n\t\t\t\t- HR Generalist Phone: 330.490.7542 Email: jhoffner@walsh.edu Office: Farrell Hall 104A About Walsh Accreditation Bookstore Campus Map Campus Safety & Security Conferences & Events Consumer Information Emergency Information Employment Maintenance Request Mass Times Non-Discrimination Policy Privacy Policy Web Accessibility 2020 East Maple Street North Canton, Ohio 44720 800.362.9846 Toll-free 330.490.7090 Local Follow us on: Like us on Facebook Follow us on X Connect with us on LinkedIn Watch us on YouTube See us on Instagram Walsh University is not affiliated with Walsh College of Accountancy in Business. Website content © Walsh University. All rights reserved. Office 365 | ECN | MyWalsh University Portal | Cavalier Center | CavClass"
